 s/179439\n\n5:00PM Reception\, 5:30PM Discussion\nDiscover the profound im
 pact of architecture on our daily lives with Our World in Ten Buildings. 
 In this illuminating work\, architectural designer and author Michael P. M
 urphy examines ten landmark projects\, from hospitals to memorials\, to re
 veal how thoughtfully designed spaces shape the way we think\, feel\, and 
 connect.\n\nBlending personal experience with deep research\, Murphy shows
  how architecture influences our health\, behavior\, and sense of communit
 y\, challenging the notion that purposeful design is only for the privileg
 ed. Accessible yet deeply insightful\, this book offers a fresh perspectiv
 e on the built environment and its power to transform our homes\, workplac
 es\, and shared spaces.\n\n*This event is complimentary and reserved for m
 embers only. Light bites and refreshments will be served.
